────────────────────
_ do emit-wrapped
    - body SyntaxId

` The function that builds the lines of a markup element's body, all content of its class's
` default slot, into a node (`emit-wrapper`), returned as the slot's type, once the state cells
` made for the rules the slot's outlet applies are bound to it.
