    =
value = leaving(value, body, true)
return-value(value.operand, body)

────────────────────
_ do emit-wrapper Typed
    - body SyntaxId

` Lines of markup content built into one node, as a slot's: an object of the slot's type made
` by the constructor the type pass recorded at the body, with the lines run as its content
` under the batch in force.
. made = emit-call(body, 0, RowRange'SyntaxId())
. type = made.type
content-hosts += Typed(made.operand, type)
content-roots += if content-roots.length != 0 then outer-root else make-operand(.operand-void, 0)
    .. outer-root = content-roots[content-roots.length - 1]
emit-block(body)
content-hosts.pop()
content-roots.pop()
