────────────────────
_ do slot-address Operand
    - slot SlotId
    - site SyntaxId

` The address of a local or an argument of the function that the capture of a `do without gc`
` block refers to: of its field in the environment that keeps it, of its cell, which stays in
` the frame, or of the memory a struct argument with no cell lies in, which the function owns.
