= nothing

────────────────────
_ do capture-value Typed
    - slot SlotId
    - type TypeId
    - site SyntaxId

` The value of a local a spawned task's body captures, where the task is spawned.
if bindings.slots[slot].kind == .slot-lazy && !task-holds(slot)
    = read-lazy-local(slot, site, type)
if !is-captured(slot)
    = copied-value(slot, type, site)
. held = find-captured(slot, site)
= Typed(take(captured-base(site), held, site), held.type)

────────────────────
_ do copied-value Typed
    - slot SlotId
    - type TypeId
    - site SyntaxId

` The value a spawned task's body copies of a local, an argument, the item of a loop or the
` receiver that no environment holds: the spawning function's own.
